# Purpose: Keep local runtime data, temporary test files, and secrets out of version control.
# Input/Output: Git ignores matching files and directories listed below.
# Invariants: No Foundry data, timed download URLs, or local logs should be committed.
# Debug: If Git still tracks something here, check `git status --ignored`.

.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
tmp/
test-output/
runtime/
*.log
